# Computed-style baselines. Throwaway by design: they are keyed by structural
# index path, so ANY content change invalidates them — a checked-in baseline
# would be stale on arrival and would only ever produce a diff nobody can read.
# Capture one immediately before a change, compare immediately after, discard.
# Left untracked but un-ignored they reached 29MB, one `git add -A` from the repo.
tests/visual/__snapshots__/
